# Goro SS2 "The Bent Sword" (sidestories/guests-07-12.md #7; after Crab Ch3, Lv 32+). Goro joined through the main
# story (Ch2, Ch4), so his SS1 isn't used; SS2 waits at the barracks on the Kaiu Wall once Ch3 is done, but not while
