FUTON = 9 | (1 << 5)


# Room furniture built from map blocks (user: the engine's library desks were huge and swallowed the cast, and it has
# no scale; "make what makes sense visually"). A block is 0.5 m. Rokugani rooms sit low: knee-high tables and desks,
