            say("Norie", "Orders. From the Champion. Who does not know your name, which is why you are useful."),
            say("Norie", "Kudo. A farm town on the River of Gold, near the Shinomen. Once Hare land, now no one's."),
            say("Norie", "The Fox and the Sparrow govern it together and hate it together."),
            say("Norie", "Someone wants it to be the seat of a new Minor Clans Court. Someone else wants it to burn."),
