            say("Rui", "A drunk dock-worker broke quarantine to collect a debt. He says something flew over him, west, "
                       "and blotted out the moon. I'd arrest the moon if I could."),
            narrate("Running feet. Kitsune Hana, robes torn, no shoes."),
            say("Hana", "The governor - he's gone! He walked into the river! He didn't sink!"),
