# production/unicorn-ch3.md, storyboards/unicorn-ch3.md, scripts/unicorn-ch3-the-noblest-blood.md (Fortune's Lost Part
# III re-read in full: the eight-pointed star, Karasu's warning, wax blocks the sound completely, the servants pull
# the hands from the ears, Shahai's barricaded tower, Daiyu by the brook, Tsukaru and Tabezu, the dead before the
# mines). Lv 30-35, early spring 1123. Tamotsu + Shinjo Ryuko + Akodo Rin; Iuchi Karasu answers the Guest call (G-1:
# a guest takes no party slot here, so Rin stays). Covered Ears (G999): the wax is in from the castle gate to the top
# of the tower; NOTE lines; voice skills lost, the servants' Hum unheard (plugin RokuganHazard). The star field M399
# (from the Buried Leaves signpost after Ch2), Shiro Iuchi's tower M400-M402, the Iuchi woods M403, the Mirumoto
# war-camp M404 (the hub; S07), the jade mines M405-M407; backdrops M878-M880.
FULL_NAMES.update({"Karasu": "Iuchi Karasu", "Shahai": "Iuchi Shahai", "Daiyu": "Iuchi Daiyu",
                   "Tsukaru": "Mirumoto Tsukaru", "Tabezu": "Mirumoto Tabezu", "Kurosho": "Iuchi Kurosho"})
