            narrate("A single sound. The crowd breathes out. The law is satisfied."),
            narrate("The market. Kagemaro, at a careful distance, does not quite look at her."),
            say("Kagemaro", "I can't thank you in public."),
            say("Sayo", "I know."),
            say("Kagemaro", "I owe you giri. A debt. I'll never be able to be seen paying it."),
